-revenue-revealed-on-michael-mcintyres-big-show/articleshow/127428933.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-01-25T02:54:31+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">Global Sports Desk</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-127428893,imgsize-633631.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[‘Possession of gun does...’: Ex-air force officer comments on Minneapolis man shot by federal agents]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/127427169.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[Adam Kinzinger, a former officer of the US Air Force, has voiced his strong objection to the tragic shooting of Alex Pretti by immigration agents in Minneapolis. He contended that the act of legally carrying a firearm should not be misrepresented as a sign of criminal intent.]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/possession-of-gun-does-not-make-him-criminal-former-us-air-force-officer-defends-minneapolis-man-shot-by-federal-agents/articleshow/127427169.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/possession-of-gun-does-not-make-him-criminal-former-us-air-force-officer-defends-minneapolis-man-shot-by-federal-agents/articleshow/127427169.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-01-25T02:25:45+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">TOI World Desk</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-127427169,imgsize-1770708.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[Who was Alex Pretti? 37-year-old identified as man shot dead by federal officers in Minneapolis]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/127423253.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[In a tragic turn of events, 37-year-old Alex Jeffrey Pretti, a US citizen, was shot dead by federal immigration agents in Minneapolis. Officials confirmed that during a large immigration enforcement operation, Pretti brandished a weapon and resisted arrest, prompting a Border Patrol agent to open fire in self-defense.]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/who-was-alex-pretti-37-year-old-identified-as-man-shot-dead-by-federal-officers-in-minneapolis/articleshow/127423253.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/who-was-alex-pretti-37-year-old-identified-as-man-shot-dead-by-federal-officers-in-minneapolis/articleshow/127423253.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-01-25T01:16:53+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">TOI World Desk</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-127423253,imgsize-1022372.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA['Let ICE do their job': Trump reacts after federal agents fatally shoot Alex Pretti in Minnesota]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/127426385.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/let-ice-do-their-job-trump-reacts-after-federal-agents-fatally-shoot-alex-pretti-in-minnesota/articleshow/127426385.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/let-ice-do-their-job-trump-reacts-after-federal-agents-fatally-shoot-alex-pretti-in-minnesota/articleshow/127426385.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-01-25T02:05:39+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">TOI World Desk</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-127426385,imgsize-1745356.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[Gigi Alayah accuses Kai Cenat of cheating following their December split]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/127423279.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[Gigi Alayah publicly accused streamer Kai Cenat of cheating, alleging she found another woman at his home. This revelation followed accusations from Kai's assistant, Brianna Lewis, of Gigi's infidelity with NBA YoungBoy, which Gigi vehemently denied, calling the messages fake and accusing Brianna of jealousy. Kai has remained silent on the matter.]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us-streamers/gigi-alayah-accuses-kai-cenat-of-cheating-following-their-december-split/articleshow/127423279.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us-streamers/gigi-alayah-accuses-kai-cenat-of-cheating-following-their-december-split/articleshow/127423279.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-01-25T01:05:00+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">Global Sports Desk</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-127423208,imgsize-862137.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[Streamer-turned-singer d4vd under investigation for murder as Celeste Rivas Hernandez case unfolds]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/127425681.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[Singer d4vd is under investigation for the murder of Celeste Rivas Hernandez, whose body was found in a car. A key witness, d4vd's friend Neo Langston, was arrested for failing to appear in court. While no charges have been filed against the musician, authorities are actively gathering evidence and testimonies in this high-profile case.]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us-streamers/streamer-turned-singer-d4vd-under-investigation-for-murder-as-celeste-rivas-hernandez-case-unfolds/articleshow/127425681.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us-streamers/streamer-turned-singer-d4vd-under-investigation-for-murder-as-celeste-rivas-hernandez-case-unfolds/articleshow/127425681.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-01-25T01:47:23+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">Global Sports Desk</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-127425642,imgsize-497790.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[‘Irrefutable evidence officers killed unarmed...’: Political commentator breaks down Minneapolis shooting video]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/127418367.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[In a tragic event that has ignited public outcry, federal immigration officials in Minneapolis were involved in a deadly shooting. Footage circulating online challenges the narrative that the individual was an imminent danger, with eyewitnesses asserting he had been subdued prior to the gunfire. This incident has prompted widespread protests and renewed demands for the dissolution of ICE.]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/irrefutable-evidence-officers-killed-unarmed-man-political-commentator-breaks-down-minneapolis-shooting-video/articleshow/127418367.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/irrefutable-evidence-officers-killed-unarmed-man-political-commentator-breaks-down-minneapolis-shooting-video/articleshow/127418367.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-01-25T00:51:20+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">TOI World Desk</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-127418367,imgsize-1021535.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[A penguin’s death march is going viral in 2026: What the ‘nihilist penguin’ meme means and how the White House reacted to it]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/ph